      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a consequence of using the \"Set View\" state behavior for an unsupported use case. That state behavior is meant to be used for setting your viewpoint after sitting down (as an example), not for use with scaling the avatar.\nWhen using it, you need to be sure to clear it-- as in, run the state behavior again but with the option set to \"Clear\" or the checkbox empty. There's a bug where some editor scripts will break the Editor UI we're using, so you'll probably just see a checkbox.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
